OL,3,GNEWSAJoey Barton alleged assault trial
OL,4,Adelayed until next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer footballer Joey Barton will not
OL,7,Fface trial over an alleged attack on a
OL,8,Fman outside a golf club until next
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FThe 44-year-old, from Widnes, Cheshire,
OL,12,Fdenies causing grievous bodily harm
OL,13,Fwith intent to Kevin Lynch, 51, at
OL,14,FFairway, Huyton, on 8 March.
OL,16,FHe was due to face trial this week but
OL,17,Fat Liverpool Crown Court earlier Judge
OL,18,FDavid Potter adjourned the trial to 8
OL,19,FMarch, 2027.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
